sequenceDiagram
    participant User
    participant React Developer
    participant NestJS Developer
    participant SQL Database Administrator
    User->>ReactDeveloper: I need a cross-platform app for managing employees and assigning tasks.
    ReactDeveloper-->>User: Do you want it to be a web application or a mobile app?
    User-->>ReactDeveloper: Cross-platform, so it would be easier to check on my work whenever I want.
    ReactDeveloper-->>User: I recommend React or Flutter for the cross-platform. What about HTML and CSS? Okay.
    ReactDeveloper-->>User: For the back end, what do you think?
    User-->>ReactDeveloper: Traditional PHP and SQL database.
    ReactDeveloper-->>SQLDatabaseAdministrator: Do you have any recommendations for the back-end stack (NestJS and MongoDB)?
    SQLDatabaseAdministrator-->>ReactDeveloper: No, I will leave it to you.
    ReactDeveloper-->>User: Are we clear?
    User-->>ReactDeveloper: Yeah, I think so.
    ReactDeveloper->>ReactDeveloper: Let's start with the front end using React and HTML/CSS.
    SQLDatabaseAdministrator->>SQLDatabaseAdministrator: Let's use traditional PHP and SQL database for the back end.
    ReactDeveloper->>ReactDeveloper: Let's start with React as the front-end framework and traditional PHP and SQL database for the back end.
    User-->>ReactDeveloper: Okay, let's get started.